<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1442936960"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:58.600"><div begin="23.009" end="48.237" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="23.009" end="28.649" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.009" end="23.450">当</span><span begin="23.450" end="24.397">初初</span><span begin="24.397" end="26.336">给他的双手</span><span begin="26.448" end="27.671">抱我那</span><span begin="27.671" end="27.911">一</span><span begin="27.911" end="28.649">瞬</span></p><p begin="29.267" end="35.251" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.267" end="29.685">曾</span><span begin="29.685" end="31.482">软软笑笑</span><span begin="31.482" end="31.808">但</span><span begin="31.808" end="32.221">不知</span><span begin="32.221" end="32.640">所</span><span begin="32.640" end="33.058">措</span><span begin="33.058" end="34.169">却竟相</span><span begin="34.169" end="35.251">信</span></p><p begin="35.833" end="41.588" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.833" end="36.217">在</span><span begin="36.217" end="37.953">世界我最</span><span begin="37.953" end="38.345">软</span><span begin="38.345" end="38.865">弱</span> <span begin="39.072" end="39.572">所以</span><span begin="39.572" end="40.007">要</span><span begin="40.007" end="40.388">他</span><span begin="40.388" end="40.868">相</span><span begin="40.868" end="41.588">拥</span></p><p begin="42.039" end="48.237" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.039" end="42.756">就让</span><span begin="42.756" end="43.244">我</span><span begin="43.244" end="44.500">那懒懒</span><span begin="44.500" end="45.007">身</span><span begin="45.007" end="45.342">躯</span><span begin="45.342" end="47.023">躲进臂弯</span><span begin="47.023" end="47.462">之</span><span begin="47.462" end="48.237">中</span></p></div><div begin="48.707" end="1:15.025" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="48.707" end="54.752" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.707" end="49.026">无</span><span begin="49.026" end="49.445">论</span><span begin="49.445" end="50.981">现实或是</span><span begin="50.981" end="51.429">造</span><span begin="51.429" end="51.916">梦</span> <span begin="52.317" end="52.670">都</span><span begin="52.670" end="53.342">给他</span><span begin="53.342" end="53.856">每秒</span><span begin="53.856" end="54.307">操</span><span begin="54.307" end="54.752">纵</span></p><p begin="54.849" end="1:00.924" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.849" end="55.164">从</span><span begin="55.164" end="55.654">来</span><span begin="55.654" end="55.836">没</span><span begin="55.836" end="56.331">发</span><span begin="56.331" end="56.790">觉</span> <span begin="57.004" end="57.355">他</span><span begin="57.355" end="57.550">的</span><span begin="57.550" end="58.337">呼吸</span><span begin="58.337" end="58.734">催</span><span begin="58.734" end="59.245">促我</span><span begin="59.245" end="59.901">变得</span><span begin="59.901" end="1:00.434">多</span><span begin="1:00.434" end="1:00.924">蠢</span></p><p begin="1:01.564" end="1:07.465" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.564" end="1:02.327">误信</span><span begin="1:02.327" end="1:02.951">了</span><span begin="1:03.157" end="1:03.838">我</span><span begin="1:03.838" end="1:04.069">弱</span><span begin="1:04.069" end="1:04.533">质</span><span begin="1:04.533" end="1:04.869">纤</span><span begin="1:04.869" end="1:05.381">纤</span> <span begin="1:05.381" end="1:05.726">随</span><span begin="1:05.726" end="1:06.118">便</span><span begin="1:06.118" end="1:06.552">也</span><span begin="1:06.552" end="1:06.872">感</span><span begin="1:06.872" end="1:07.465">动</span></p><p begin="1:07.658" end="1:15.025" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:07.658" end="1:08.418">并未</span><span begin="1:08.418" end="1:09.266">知道</span><span begin="1:09.266" end="1:10.481">我也可</span><span begin="1:10.481" end="1:11.031">以</span><span begin="1:11.280" end="1:12.097">完全</span><span begin="1:12.097" end="1:12.633">麻</span><span begin="1:12.633" end="1:12.947">木</span><span begin="1:12.947" end="1:13.407">放</span><span begin="1:13.407" end="1:15.025">纵</span></p></div><div begin="1:14.359" end="1:43.619" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:14.359" end="1:17.707" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v2000"><span begin="1:14.359" end="1:14.597">多</span><span begin="1:14.597" end="1:15.004">得</span><span begin="1:15.004" end="1:15.427">他</span><span begin="1:15.427" end="1:15.771">给</span><span begin="1:15.771" end="1:16.198">我</span><span begin="1:16.198" end="1:16.606">勇</span><span begin="1:16.606" end="1:17.707">气</span></p><p begin="1:20.644" end="1:26.836" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.644" end="1:21.435">真的</span><span begin="1:21.435" end="1:21.934">要</span><span begin="1:21.934" end="1:22.691">多得</span><span begin="1:22.691" end="1:23.222">他</span> <span begin="1:23.378" end="1:24.064">去使我</span><span begin="1:24.064" end="1:24.472">懂</span><span begin="1:24.472" end="1:24.861">得</span> <span begin="1:25.004" end="1:25.605">每一个</span><span begin="1:25.605" end="1:25.965">故事</span><span begin="1:25.965" end="1:26.319">结</span><span begin="1:26.319" end="1:26.836">尾</span></p><p begin="1:26.836" end="1:31.368" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.836" end="1:27.992">无非别</span><span begin="1:27.992" end="1:28.532">离</span> <span begin="1:28.532" end="1:28.885">总</span><span begin="1:28.885" end="1:29.320">是</span><span begin="1:29.320" end="1:29.690">别</span><span begin="1:29.690" end="1:31.368">离</span></p><p begin="1:33.628" end="1:43.619" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.628" end="1:34.509">失去</span><span begin="1:34.509" end="1:34.940">他</span><span begin="1:34.940" end="1:35.324">先</span><span begin="1:35.324" end="1:35.626">知</span> <span begin="1:35.626" end="1:35.829">我</span><span begin="1:35.829" end="1:36.213">也</span><span begin="1:36.213" end="1:36.664">可</span><span begin="1:36.664" end="1:36.940">不</span><span begin="1:36.940" end="1:37.400">需</span><span begin="1:37.400" end="1:37.706">要</span><span begin="1:37.847" end="1:38.344">那臂</